# Design Template: Velzon (`public/master`) — Mandatory

For **all** UI in this project (public, auth, applicant, staff, admin), the visual design system is the **Velzon** HTML admin template stored at:

**`public/master/`** (served as `/master/...`)

This rule **overrides** generic “Tailwind-only / invent a new aesthetic” guidance for layout and look-and-feel. Backend remains Laravel API + Axios SPA; the **screen chrome and components** must follow Velzon.

## Source of truth

Before building or restyling any page:

1. Open the closest demo HTML under `public/master/` (examples below).
2. Reuse its structure, CSS classes, spacing, cards, tables, forms, modals, and auth shells.
3. Wire Blade/JS to those patterns; load Velzon assets from `/master/assets/...`.
4. Do **not** invent a parallel design system (custom slate/glass landing, one-off Tailwind themes, Bootstrap-from-scratch, etc.).

