|-------------|------------|
| Admin / staff dashboard | `public/master/index.html`, `pages-starter.html` |
| Vertical layout / sidebar | `layouts-vertical-hovered.html`, `index.html` |
| Sign in | `auth-signin-basic.html` or `auth-signin-cover.html` |
| Sign up / register | `auth-signup-basic.html` or `auth-signup-cover.html` |
